# Bootloader packages for the installer, stored in a small package repository
# on the USB stick (dists/ and pool/). Debian's installer helpers point the new
# system at that repository and install GRUB from it, so this also works
# without internet. Includes the Secure Boot-signed GRUB and shim, so the
# installed system starts with Secure Boot switched on.
# (BIOS GRUB is in its own list because grub-pc and grub-efi-amd64 conflict.)
grub-efi
grub-efi-amd64
grub-efi-amd64-bin
grub-efi-amd64-signed
shim-signed
efibootmgr
os-prober
cryptsetup
cryptsetup-initramfs
keyutils
